                  <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
                  <td class='result-snippet'>
                    A <b>grind</b> <b>configuration</b> that only uses cutsat, splitting, and the @ [lia] lemma set. Note: cutsat benefits from some amount of instantiation, e.g. Nat.max_def. Lemmas tagged with the @ [lia] attribute are instantiated via E-matching when running lia, while the much larger @ [<b>grind</b>] lemma set is left disabled.
                  </td>
